        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/{size}/1920_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-07-11T19:13:23.837Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Defend on your turn? Time to prepare, set yourself up for success, full dice pool.</p>\n<p>Defend as a reaction ability? You have some training, but you are still reacting in a split second, one die.</p>\n<p>Defend as “Hit the deck”? No training, panicked emergency dive to avoid damage, one die plus a twist.</p>\n<p>They encourage defense actions if you encourage yourself to make them, by choosing abilities that help you defend.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-07-11T19:13:23.837Z",
        "reply_count": 1,
        "reply_to_post_number": 5,
