        "created_at": "2021-07-11T20:45:08.935Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I get the logic you just laid out. I made a big topic on the question, because I think this gets pretty complicated pretty fast.</p>\n<p>I agree with your breakdown in one sense, but defending on your turn is a terrible decision, and a few of the reaction abilities are very very powerful, while others are incredibly weak and situational.</p>",
